{"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Overview","anchor":"Overview","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Swidux ships a companion agent skill (","type":"text"},{"code":"swidux-ref","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":") for AI coding assistants like Claude Code. It contains the architecture rules, conventions, and code templates an assistant needs to generate correct Swidux code without you re-explaining the patterns.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The skill is published in "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/heirloomlogic\/skills","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" — Heirloom Logic’s public skills repo — alongside any future Heirloom skills. Two files:"}]},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"SKILL.md","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" — architecture rules (the 10 rules, the dispatch lifecycle, plugin shapes, anti-patterns)."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"swidux-patterns.md","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" — copy-pasteable code templates for "},{"code":"AppState","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"code":"AppAction","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", reducers, ","type":"text"},{"code":"AppStore","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" factory, views, plugin wiring, and Swift Testing reducer tests.","type":"text"}]}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Installing the skill","anchor":"Installing-the-skill"},{"level":3,"type":"heading","text":"GitHub CLI (recommended)","anchor":"GitHub-CLI-recommended"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Requires ","type":"text"},{"code":"gh","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" ≥ v2.90.0 (","type":"text"},{"identifier":"https:\/\/cli.github.com","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":").","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["gh skill install heirloomlogic\/skills swidux-ref --agent claude-code -